   "key": "func OneShotBackupName.fullerUnindexedBackup(than:in:)",
   "hash": "671235310b48a41c",
   "does": "Returns nil when the row's write time (indexedMs) or beat count (backedUpCount, or beatCount for a one-shot row) is unknown, as for a row rebuilt from a header. Otherwise walks the session's one-shot files other than the indexed one, plain or encrypted, whatever their stamp; decodes each (decodeLegacyBackup decrypts sealed ones; failures logged by attempt) and keeps only the fullest so far for this session that holds strictly more beats than the row, so at most two decoded entries are alive at once. Returns it, or nil. Strictly more: an adopted source then holds as many as the new row and is not adopted again. Throws when the listing fails.",
